{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 27, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "## Lost (and Found) in Japan\n\nJust back from the most incredible trip to Japan! It was a whirlwind of ancient traditions and futuristic technology, a truly captivating contrast. \n\nMy journey started in Tokyo, a dazzling metropolis. Shibuya Crossing was an absolute must-see – the organized chaos is mesmerizing! I explored vibrant neighborhoods like Harajuku, soaking up the unique street style, and found tranquility in the serene Meiji Jingu Shrine. The food was phenomenal – from fresh sushi at the Tsukiji Outer Market to comforting bowls of ramen, every meal was a delight.\n\nNext, I took a bullet train to Kyoto, the cultural heart of Japan.  Wandering through the bamboo forest in Arashiyama felt like stepping into another world.  Visiting Fushimi Inari Shrine with its thousands of red torii gates was breathtaking.  I even participated in a traditional tea ceremony, a truly humbling experience.\n\nBeyond the cities, I spent a day exploring Nara Park, where friendly deer roam freely – a surprisingly charming experience!\n\nJapan is a country that assaults the senses in the best possible way.  It's a place of incredible politeness, stunning beauty, and delicious food.  I barely scratched the surface, and I'm already dreaming of my return.  Sayonara for now, Japan!\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": "▁Lost", "logprob": -0.0012646066024899483}, {"token": "▁(", "logprob": -0.14694757759571075}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": "▁Found", "logprob": -0.0011703077470883727}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.11968507617712021}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.10141423344612122}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.18620890378952026}, {"token": "Just", "logprob": -0.8619251251220703}, {"token": "▁back", "logprob": -0.03705744072794914}, {"token": "▁from",